# - Add more level 3 terms once Databricks metadata is available
# - Expand FIBO bridging (currently 5 bridges, target 15-20)
# - Add skos:note and skos:example where useful
# - Add dct:source provenance links to policy documents
# - Validate with SPARQL competency queries
# - Review with domain expert / data steward
# ==========================================================================
